        heading: "Two common formats, different trade-offs",
        body: "<p>Injections and gels are two of the most common ways to deliver testosterone, and men often weigh them against each other. Neither is simply better. The right choice depends on how you feel about needles, how steady you want your levels, your budget, and safety factors like whether young children are in your home. This guide stays educational and does not cover doses or technique. For the full menu of formats, see <a href=\"/articles/types-of-trt\">types of TRT</a>.</p>",
