      "The complete 2026 guide to testosterone replacement therapy (TRT): what it is, who it is for, how diagnosis and treatment work, the real benefits and risks, every delivery method, what it costs, how online TRT works, and how to choose a clinic - written to be clear, accurate and compliance-minded.",
